VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Gentleman_1::
	.string "I’m the CHAIRMAN of the POKéMON FAN\n"
	.string "CLUB.\p"
	.string "I’ve raised over 150 POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I’m very fussy when it comes to\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Did you visit just to hear about my\n"
	.string "POKéMON?$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Gentleman_2::
	.string "How disappointing...\p"
	.string "Come back if you want to listen.$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Gentleman_3::
	.string "Hello, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "Did you come see me about my\n"
	.string "POKéMON again?\p"
	.string "No? Oh... I had more tales to tell...$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Gentleman_4::
	.string "Good!\n"
	.string "Then listen up!\p"
	.string "So... my favourite RAPIDASH...\p"
	.string "It... cute... lovely... smart...\p"
	.string "unbearably... plus... amazing...\p"
	.string "oh... you think so?...\p"
	.string "Too much... wild...\p"
	.string "beautiful... kindly...\p"
	.string "love it!\p"
	.string "Hug it... when... sleeping... warm\n"
	.string "and\p"
	.string "cuddly... Oh, and...\p"
	.string "spectacular...\p"
	.string "ravishing... simply divine...$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Gentleman_5::
	.string "Oops! Look at the time! I’ve kept\n"
	.string "you too long!\p"
	.string "Thanks for hearing me out. I want you\n"
	.string "to have this!$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Gentleman_6::
	.string "It’s a RARE CANDY that makes POKéMON\n"
	.string "stronger.\p"
	.string "I prefer making my POKéMON stronger\n"
	.string "by battling, so you can have it.$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Beauty::
	.string "Our chairman is very vocal when it\n"
	.string "comes to POKéMON...$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Chansey::
	.string "CHANSEY: Chaaaansey!$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Clefairy::
	.string "It’s a CLEFAIRY!\n"
	.string "Huh?\p"
	.string "Oh, right. It’s a CLEFAIRY POKéDOLL.$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_FatMan_1::
	.string "I love the way CLEFAIRY waggles\n"
	.string "its finger when it’s trying to use\l"
	.string "METRONOME.\l"
	.string "It’s so adorable!$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_FatMan_2::
	.string "You watch. I’m going to get a\n"
	.string "real CLEFAIRY as my friend.$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_FatMan_3::
	.string "I love CLEFAIRY, but I could never\n"
	.string "catch one. So I’m making do with a\l"
	.string "POKéDOLL that I found.$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_FatMan_4::
	.string "Oh, I see now. The girl who lost this\n"
	.string "POKéDOLL is sad...\p"
	.string "OK. Could you take this POKéDOLL\n"
	.string "back to that poor little girl?\p"
	.string "I’ll befriend a real CLEFAIRY on\n"
	.string "my own one day.\l"
	.string "No worries!$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Woman2::
	.string "Look at my darling CHANSEY!\p"
	.string "Ain’t she a lovely nursey?\n"
	.string "She’s so cute!$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Sign1::
	.string "Let’s all listen politely to other\n"
	.string "trainers.$"

VermilionCity_Interior13_Text_Sign2::
	.string "If someone brags, brag right back!$"
